<p>Remove all effects on an object with certain limitations
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Void%20keyword" title="Void keyword">void</a> RemoveAllEffects(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oTarget,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> bIgnoreInjuries&#160;= TRUE,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> bDeath&#160;= FALSE<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oTarget<dd>The object to remove the effect from<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bIgnoreInjuries<dd>Don't remove effects that are due to injuries (that are within a certain ability id range<sup>[<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Category%20-%20Articles%20with%20documentation%20requests" title="Category:Articles with documentation requests">Undocumented</a>]</sup>)<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bDeath<dd>Don't remove effects that ignore death (use this when removing effects on a creature due to it dying)
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Nothing.
</p>
